{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Hey John! It's been ages since we last talked. Guess what? Last week I went to a Harry Potter conference in the UK - it was incredible! There were so many people who shared the same love of HP as me, it was like a magical family. I felt so inspired and like I got a new lease of life. I love how my passion for fantasy stuff brings me closer to people from all over the world, it's pretty cool."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-43/session_13-318abbdca42bae248ea57c02", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:42:39.155977+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "318abbdca42bae248ea57c02", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "318abbdca42bae248ea57c02", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Hey Tim! Great to hear from you. It's awesome how our passions connect us with others, yeah? You sound like you fit right in and got a real buzz out of it. I feel the same way with my team."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-43/session_13-74c8714ef7bc8c8f1b9446be", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:42:39.190579+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "74c8714ef7bc8c8f1b9446be", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "74c8714ef7bc8c8f1b9446be", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Wow, you guys look great! How have games been going?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-43/session_13-5c3e89c0f86973e226d85804", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:42:39.210903+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5c3e89c0f86973e226d85804", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5c3e89c0f86973e226d85804", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: It was an intense season with both tough losses and great wins. Overall, I'd say we did pretty well."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-43/session_13-d13b306596db6d41ac14fb8d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:42:39.228932+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d13b306596db6d41ac14fb8d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d13b306596db6d41ac14fb8d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Cool! Sounds like you guys had some tough games. How did you handle those?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-43/session_13-42257a9310fc6e2c4dd81443", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:42:39.247883+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "42257a9310fc6e2c4dd81443", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "42257a9310fc6e2c4dd81443", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks! We faced tough opponents but that's what drives us to get better. We back each other up and won't quit."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-43/session_13-aa2f07e775d5e3c657fa600e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:42:39.264835+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "aa2f07e775d5e3c657fa600e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "aa2f07e775d5e3c657fa600e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Congrats! That's awesome. It must feel good, right?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-43/session_13-e8647b6228ab49d99964b1f5", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:42:39.282603+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e8647b6228ab49d99964b1f5", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e8647b6228ab49d99964b1f5", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yeah, it feels great! All that hard work and effort was totally worth it. We even won a trophy!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-43/session_13-da0ba46f2020ccfa25468f20", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:42:39.298085+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "da0ba46f2020ccfa25468f20", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "da0ba46f2020ccfa25468f20", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Way to go! You must have been elated up there with that trophy. All the hard work paid off! Congrats - I'm so proud of you. Keep it up!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-43/session_13-014e437a67baa743df48570e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:42:39.317507+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "014e437a67baa743df48570e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "014e437a67baa743df48570e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks! I was definitely elated. Your support really means a lot to me. I'll keep working hard."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-43/session_13-89f982cea8306834ef389cb7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:42:39.353377+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "89f982cea8306834ef389cb7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "89f982cea8306834ef389cb7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: No problem! I'm here for you anytime. Keep believing in yourself!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-43/session_13-b78c9282fe8f3567fb6540a8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:42:39.379345+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b78c9282fe8f3567fb6540a8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b78c9282fe8f3567fb6540a8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks! Appreciate your support. Always staying filled with self-belief."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-43/session_13-b4b347100c0b7aa843bebf3d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:42:39.402610+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b4b347100c0b7aa843bebf3d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b4b347100c0b7aa843bebf3d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: You got this! Stay motivated and remember that anything is possible with hard work. Keep pushing for your goals!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-43/session_13-3853112f11dcfafcd88010cc", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:42:39.420165+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3853112f11dcfafcd88010cc", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3853112f11dcfafcd88010cc", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks! Your encouragement means a lot to me. I'm feeling motivated and ready to keep pushing for my goals! I'm going to need some new shoes after all these games though."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-43/session_13-05a4e9e559d9d8d842446416", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:42:39.442201+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "05a4e9e559d9d8d842446416", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "05a4e9e559d9d8d842446416", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
